    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like it's not that simple though. i try to be good, i try to make it up to them, but the damage is done. i look at them and i just see the shadow of what things used to be because of me. it’s like... no matter what i do, i'm just the problem. i feel like i'm just dragging everyone down with me into the dirt.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
